[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19140.19, "timestamp": "05:19:00", "text": "えーと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19143.75, "timestamp": "05:19:03", "text": "アメダ。ああ、彼女は戻ってきて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19145.55, "timestamp": "05:19:05", "text": "コンサート。ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19147.47, "timestamp": "05:19:07", "text": "素敵なケース"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19154.708, "timestamp": "05:19:14", "text": "私のYouTubeチャンネルをカバーしてください。そうそう。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19157.03, "timestamp": "05:19:17", "text": "サイクリング仲間でもある。私はそれについて見ました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19158.868, "timestamp": "05:19:18", "text": "そこに自転車仲間がいる。まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19161.11, "timestamp": "05:19:21", "text": "オフライン版をダウンロードできます。の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19165.55, "timestamp": "05:19:25", "text": "コミュニティはそれを作っていて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19169.868, "timestamp": "05:19:29", "text": "えーっと、えーっと、なんて言うんだっけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19171.628, "timestamp": "05:19:31", "text": "それ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19175.35, "timestamp": "05:19:35", "text": "えっと、彼らはシーズン2を選ぶことにしたんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19177.99, "timestamp": "05:19:37", "text": "もし私が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19180.217, "timestamp": "05:19:40", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"was\" makin it, until the creators were like, nono"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19181.07, "timestamp": "05:19:41", "text": "Cycleをプレイし始めたとき、それは正しかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19184.15, "timestamp": "05:19:44", "text": "池。ああ、そうだけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19186.23, "timestamp": "05:19:46", "text": "彼らはマルチプレイヤーに取り組むだろうが、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19188.43, "timestamp": "05:19:48", "text": "私にできるかどうかさえわからない"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19194.545, "timestamp": "05:19:54", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWd